---
import candidates from '../../data/studio-candidates.json';
import data from '../../data/studio.json';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Honorato · Design studio</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f2f0ea;color:#222;font:16px/1.5 system-ui}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:.2em}header,main,footer{max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding:2rem clamp(1rem,4vw,4rem)}header nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,7vw,6rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em;max-width:15ch;font-weight:500;margin:4rem 0 2rem}.intro{max-width:65ch;font-size:1.2rem}.concept{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid #aaa}.concept img{width:100%;height:430px;object-fit:cover}.concept h2{font-size:2.4rem;line-height:1.1;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 1.2rem}.actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:2rem 0}.button{background:#202521;color:white;padding:1rem 1.3rem;text-decoration:none}.secondary{padding:1rem 0}details{margin-top:1rem}summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.6rem 0}.plan{padding:1rem 0}li{margin-bottom:.6rem}small,.note{color:#565a52}.resource{background:#e2e5dc;padding:2rem;margin:3rem 0}.resource h2{margin-top:0}footer{border-top:1px solid #aaa}.photo-role{font-size:.9rem}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9c2726;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:760px){.concept{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}.concept img{height:300px}h1{margin-top:2rem}.concept h2{font-size:2rem}}
</style></head><body><header><nav><strong>101 / Honorato</strong><a href="/studio/map/">Component & skill map</a><a href="/about/">About this preview</a></nav><h1>Different ideas.<br/>A reason for each.</h1><p class="intro">Three complete composition proposals for Honorato. Each explains the customer journey and photo choices, then uses the same source-backed catalogue and contact destinations.</p><p class="note">Exploration, not a winning-skill ranking. These concepts are provisional. No Thomas/Gabo approval has been recorded.</p></header><main>
{candidates.map(c=>{const p=c.photo_plan?.[0];const image=data.assets.find(a=>a.id===p?.asset_id)||data.assets[0];return <article class="concept"><a href={`/studio/${c.id}/`} aria-label={`Open ${c.label}`}><img src={image.uri} alt={image.alt} width={image.width} height={image.height}/></a><div><h2>{c.label}</h2><p>{c.thesis}</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/studio/${c.id}/`}>Open the website</a><a class="secondary" href={`/studio/${c.id}/carta/`}>Try the menu</a></div><p class="note">{c.tradeoff}</p><details><summary>Why these pages?</summary>{c.page_plan.map(p=><div class="plan"><strong>{p.customer_question}</strong><p>{p.purpose}</p></div>)}</details><details><summary>Why these photographs?</summary><ul>{c.photo_plan.map(p=><li><strong>{p.asset_id}</strong> — {p.reason}<br/><span class="photo-role">{p.role} · {p.crop}</span></li>)}</ul></details><details><summary>Method and motion</summary><p>Creator method: {c.recipe}. The creator could change the HTML structure, composition and asset selection.</p><p>{c.motion_intent}</p><p class="note">This coordinator gallery reveals methods. It is not a blinded preference session.</p></details></div></article>})}
<section class="resource"><h2>One shared map, different compositions.</h2><p>Start from a customer task, see the evidence it needs, then select an implementation. A dropdown menu and a bakery catalogue are different capabilities.</p><a href="/studio/map/">Explore the component and skill map</a></section>
</main><footer><p>12 observed products · 8 curated photographs · real category/search/detail navigation.</p><p class="note">Private proposals using retained sources. Current availability, prices, opening hours and publication rights still need confirmation. The earlier four CSS-only candidates remain preserved.</p></footer></body></html>
